{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38352","headline":"重阳日荆州作 · 吴融","name":"重阳日荆州作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里投荒已自哀，高秋寓目更徘徊。\n浊醪任冷难辞醉，黄菊因暄却未开。\n上国莫归戎马乱，故人何在塞鸿来。\n惊时感事俱无奈，不待残阳下楚台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}